{"product_id":"the-soterion-mission","title":"The Soterion Mission","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn a post-apocalyptic world where no-one lives beyond their teenage years, the mysterious Roxanne arrives in Cyrus's village, fleeing the barbaric Zeds. She claims to be on a mission that can save them all, but can she be trusted? Cyrus joins her in her quest for the legendary Soterion, but the Zeds are determined to get there first.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Stewart Ross\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781782020141\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 232\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45748947386521,"sku":"16RB-4-9781782020141","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d6315b93e9b_The_Soterion_Mission_Stewart_Ross.jpg?v=1758895150","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-soterion-mission","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}